# Lieutenant Nyota Uhura's X is "the number of differently named lands you control": Bot2's own Forest is not one of them, and a
# second Forest adds no name to the two Bot1 already has. Each activation exiles exactly two cards, and the Lightning Bolt that a
# third card would have made castable is never reached - so no free cast is offered and nothing is dealt. Turn 3: one Island and
# one Forest for X of 2 while Bot2 has a Forest of its own (X of 3 would exile its Lightning Bolt and offer it). Turn 5: a second
# Forest, three lands and still two names (X of 3 would reach the further Bolt). Both exiles are bottomed, leaving nothing exiled.

